            browser (browser type, operating system, screen size), together
            with a random identifier stored in your browser (see section 5).
          </p>
          <ul class="ml-5 flex list-disc flex-col gap-2">
            <li>
              <strong class="text-foreground">We do not record your sessions:</strong>{' '}
              PostHog's session recording is turned off.
